mal.jpg", "h": 4080, "handle": "a_random_2020_", "id": "2109702677395624153", "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUcrGACbUAAo2_I.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 9.3, "text": "Went to Santosh Mitra Square today and it did give me goosebumps, an opportunity to pay tributes to our greatest freedom fighters and also reflect on the horrors of Partition", "url": "https://x.com/a_random_2020_/status/2109702677395624153", "w": 3060}, {"at": "2026-10-12T02:25:32.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1707607623984705536/dZXzGK5C_normal.jpg", "h": 3000, "handle": "souv_i_k", "id": "2109470494454120733", "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUZYLgVa0AA_Znc.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 8.48, "text": "Our pujo starts from famous Santosh Mitra square .amazing theme with full of patriotism.  Today is 1st day of pujo and it's completely packed", "url": "https://x.com/souv_i_k/status/2109470494454120733", "w": 4000}], "sree-bhumi-sporting-club": [{"at": "2026-10-11T13:30:01.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1998588969983016960/Y852kCAZ_normal.jpg", "handle": "HeyyyyShubham", "id": "2109275327331537045", "score": 6.85, "text": "I'm already missing the days when I was in Kolkata during Navratri and Durga Puja! When I was studying for CA Foundation, I had coaching friends, and we went to Sreebhumi Sporting Club together. Another year, I went with a female friend I met during my IT training.", "url": "https://x.com/HeyyyyShubham/status/2109275327331537045"}]}}